1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
我們把公館汀州路三段，打造成數位孿生場景。
We recreated Section 3 of Tingzhou Road in Gongguan as a digital twin.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,800
用來產生訓練影像，也能反覆測試自動避閃。
It generates training images and lets us repeat avoidance tests.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:12,600
我們用這些影像，訓練了第一版視覺模型。
We used these images to train our first vision model.

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:16,600
畫面上的框，就是模型辨識出的汽車和機車。
These boxes show the cars and motorcycles detected by the model.

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:21,400
但光知道有車，還不夠判斷會不會撞上。
Recognizing a vehicle alone does not tell us whether it is in our path.

6
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:26,200
所以我們加入 Raycast，模擬雷達的距離感測。
We add raycasts to simulate radar-like distance sensing.

7
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:31,000
量出障礙物的距離，並估計它的移動方向。
They measure obstacle distance and estimate its motion.

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,300
辨識結果會和射線偵測到的物體配對。
Visual detections are matched to objects detected by the rays.

9
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:39,600
再交給規則控制器，決定煞車或繞開。
A rule-based controller then decides whether to brake or steer around.

10
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:43,400
像這台停在路邊的車，其實沒有擋住路徑。
This roadside car is visible, but it is not blocking our path.

11
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:47,400
只看影像框的左邊，卻把它當成威脅而煞車。
The image-box rule on the left treats it as a hazard and brakes.

12
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:52,200
右邊結合 Raycast 確認能通過，就能少一次虛警。
On the right, raycast geometry confirms clearance and avoids this false alarm.

13
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,500
濃霧則是另一個挑戰。
Dense fog presents another challenge.

14
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,800
等相機看清楚前方違停的車，可能已經來不及。
A car stopped in the lane may become visible too late to react.

15
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:02,600
這時即使視覺沒有可靠的辨識結果，
Even without reliable visual detections,

16
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:06,400
Raycast 仍能提供距離資訊，讓系統避開障礙。
raycasts still provide distance information for avoidance in this simulation.

17
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:10,200
下一步，我們會把模型部署到 UGen300，
Next, we plan to deploy the model on UGen300,

18
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:14,000
量測反應延遲、耗電，以及量化後的辨識表現。
and measure latency, power use, and detection quality after quantization.

19
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:19,800
再加入更多道路和真實影像，測試不同路況下能不能穩定運作。
We will add more roads and real camera data to test reliability across conditions.
